[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0133","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-0530","title":"Apple QuickTime Windows 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本在 Windows 系统上安装时，将用户配置文件中的 \"Apple Computer\" 目录权限设置为过于宽松的权限，导致本地低权限用户可读取该目录下的敏感文件，造成信息泄露。攻击者只需拥有本地账户登录权限即可利用，无需交互，攻击复杂度低。Apple 已发布 QuickTime 7.6.9 版本修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0530"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-09T20:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:16:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.6.9 或更高版本。对于 Windows 系统，同时手动修正 %UserProfile%\\Apple Computer 目录的权限设置，移除 Everyone 和 Users 组的非必要访问权限，仅保留当前用户和管理员完全控制权限。如无法升级，可考虑使用组策略限制本地用户对用户配置文件中 Apple Computer 目录的读取权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024829","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0530.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0530","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-0530.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-ww87-xv54-4xg7/GHSA-ww87-xv54-4xg7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0530.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_apple_quicktime_mult_vuln_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_769.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa97692