8/documents/100127248","http://twitter.com/msftsecresponse/statuses/7590788200402945","http://www.exploit-db.com/bypassing-uac-with-user-privilege-under-windows-vista7-mirror/","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15609/","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/529673","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45045","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025046","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0324","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2011/ms11-011","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12162","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-4398","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15609","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-4398.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2010-4398/README.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/af432ce694af9b2d5092deb1a30c46795d1006bd/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2010-4398.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4398.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2010-4398/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2010-4398.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4398","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2010-4398/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-4398.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-4398.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4398.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0109","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4282","title":"Pandora FMS 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Pandora FMS 在 3.1.1 版本之前存在多个目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 ajax.php 的 page 参数、general/pandora_help.php 的 id 参数，或 operation/agentes/networkmap.php 的 layout 参数传入包含 \"../\" 等路径遍历序列的特制请求，利用 PHP 本地文件包含机制读取、包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。其中 networkmap.php 的 layout 参数更可被滥用来创建、修改或删除任意本地文件。该漏洞影响所有 3.1.1 之前的 Pandora FMS 版本，攻击仅需网络访问 Web 接口即可发起，无需登录凭证，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4282"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-12-02T17:15:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:30Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Pandora FMS 至 3.1.1 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含目录遍历序列（如 ../）的 page、id、layout 参数请求，并限制 ajax.php、pandora_help.php、networkmap.php 的访问权限为仅可信 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69543","http://osvdb.org/69544","http://osvdb.org/69545","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2010/Nov/326","http://secunia.com/advisories/42347","http://sourceforge.net/projects/pandora/files/Pandora%20FMS%203.1/Final%20version%20%28Stable%29/pandorafms_console-3.1_security_patch_13Oct2010.tar.gz/download","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15643","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/514939/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45112","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4282.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4282.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4282.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-4282.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-4282-2001_1.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-4282-1999.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2010-4282-2002.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-4282_4.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/35fe940be4a8cc841207d0ee607b7714e4ad436d/2010/CVE-2010-4282.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-4282_25.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0109.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0254","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4008","title":"libxml2 XPath 表达式处理内存错误读取拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libxml2 在处理畸形 XPath 表达式时存在无效内存读取漏洞。攻击者可构造特制的 XML 文档，当使用 libxml2 解析该文档中的 XPath 表达式时，程序会从无效内存地址读取数据，导致应用崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 libxml2 2.7.8 之前版本，被广泛集成于 Google Chrome 7.0.517.44 之前版本、Apple Safari 5.0.2 及更早版本、OpenOffice 等产品中。攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意 XML 文件或访问恶意网站触发漏洞，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度较高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4008"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-17T01:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:58Z","remediation":"将 libxml2 升级至 2.7.8 或更高版本。各受影响产品的具体修复版本：Google Chrome 升级至 7.0.517.44 及以上，Apple Safari 升级至 5.0.3 及以上，OpenOffice 升级至 3.3 及以上。Linux 用户可通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade libxml2，Red Hat/CentOS 执行 yum update libxml2。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对传入的 XML 文档进行 XPath 表达式合法性校验，过滤畸形 XPath 输入以降低拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.bkis.com/en/libxml2-vulnerability-in-google-chrome-and-apple-safari/","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=58731","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2010/11/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011//Mar/msg00004.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-12/msg00000.html","http://mail.gnome.org/archives/xml/2010-November/msg00015.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=130331363227777&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139447903326211&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0217.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40775","http://secunia.com/advisories/42109","http://secunia.com/advisories/42175","http://secunia.com/advisories/42314","http://secunia.com/advisories/42429","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4456","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4554","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4566","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4581","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-2128","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:243","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2010-4008_CVE-2010-4494.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1749.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44779","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1016-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/3046","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/3076","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/3100","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0230","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12148","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2010/CVE-2010-4008.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4008.json","https://github.com/apache/openoffice-org/blob/8229366d1e4d6b49b6b7814c530e13f2c4dcb931/content/security/cves/CVE-2010-4008_CVE-2010-4494.html","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4008","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/nuget/libxml2/CVE-2010-4008.yml","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4008.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-4008","https://github.com/SunStarSys/orion/blob/845dc4a772afcfef0a471ab5dd3dbc00f5e99397/ooo-trunk/content/security/cves/CVE-2010-4008_CVE-2010-4494.html","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2010-4008.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0107","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4231","title":"Camtron CMNC-200 IP 摄像机 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Camtron CMNC-200 全高清网络摄像机及 TecVoz CMNC-200 百万像素网络摄像机（固件版本 1.102A-008）的 Web 管理界面存在目录遍历漏洞。其 HTTP 服务在处理请求 URI 时未对 ../ 路径序列进行充分过滤与规范化校验，导致路径穿越防护失效。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向设备 80 端口发送包含 ../ 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，即可绕过目录限制读取设备文件系统上的任意文件，如配置文件、用户凭据等敏感信息。攻击仅需网络可达目标且无需登录凭证，影响上述固件版本的设备，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4231"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-11-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"由于厂商未发布正式补丁，建议在网络边界通过 ACL 限制仅授权管理 IP 访问摄像头 Web 管理端口（80/443），并使用 VLAN 隔离防止横向访问；如必须暴露 Web 界面，请在反向代理上启用 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 等目录遍历载荷的请求，并定期审计设备配置文件访问日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15505","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/514753/100/0/threaded","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4231.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4231.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/main/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4231.json","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2010-4231-EXPLOIT"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0248","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3795","title":"苹果 QuickTime 媒体文件处理内存访问漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 10.6.x 版本 10.6.5 之前的 QuickTime 在处理 GIF 图像数据时存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 GIF 文件，触发未初始化内存访问，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.x 版本（10.6.5 之前），CVSS 评分 6.8（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于中等严重度漏洞。攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意 GIF 文件才能触发漏洞，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，无需认证即可利用。Apple 已在 Mac OS X 10.6.5 更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3795"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 QuickTime 至 7.6.9 或更高版本，或将 Mac OS X 10.6.x 升级至 10.6.5 及以上版本（通过 Apple 菜单 → \"软件更新\" 安装 Security Update 2010-007）。若暂时无法升级，请勿打开不可信来源的 GIF 图像文件，并禁用浏览器自动打开 GIF 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3795.json","https:/