tle":"Apple QuickTime Sorenson 编码影片文件内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理 Sorenson 编码影片文件时存在内存破坏漏洞，属于 CWE-119 内存操作不当问题。远程攻击者可构造特制的 Sorenson 影片文件，通过诱导用户打开恶意文件触发内存损坏，导致应用程序崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.x 至 10.6.5 及 QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本，攻击复杂度较高，需用户交互配合。Apple 已在 2010 年 11 月发布的 Mac OS X 10.6.5 安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3793"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"升级 QuickTime 至 7.6.9 或更高版本，同时将 Mac OS X 升级至 10.6.5 或更高版本。无法立即升级时，避免在浏览器中打开来源不明的 Sorenson 编码媒体文件，并禁用 QuickTime 浏览器插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2010/CVE-2010-3793.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3793.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3793","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3793.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-3793.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fpmh-3m9h-g5j3/GHSA-fpmh-3m9h-g5j3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_macosx_su10-007.nasl","https://github.com/yingdongucas/inconsistency_detection/blob/ae69c4fdb796e9540716e0fbf8686c5c8d29a42b/dataset/re_data/overflow_full_dup.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_769.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0246.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0245","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3792","title":"Apple QuickTime MPEG文件处理整数符号错误远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理特制 MPEG 编码影片文件时存在整数符号错误漏洞。由于对 MPEG 文件中相关字段的符号性判断不当，远程攻击者可构造恶意 MPEG 影片文件，通过诱导用户打开该文件触发漏洞，导致应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.5 之前版本及 QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本，攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互配合。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3792"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"升级 QuickTime 至 7.6.9 或更高版本（Windows 系统），或通过 Apple 软件更新将 Mac OS X 升级至 10.6.5。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 MPEG 媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3792.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3792","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3792.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3792.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x44w-r4m7-73mv/GHSA-x44w-r4m7-73mv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_macosx_su10-007.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_769.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_113900_114000.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime769.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x45000/44790/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0244","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3791","title":"Apple Mac OS X QuickTime MPEG编码影片文件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理 MPEG 编码影片文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序对特制 MPEG 影片文件中的畸形数据缺乏正确的边界检查，导致堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意构造的 MPEG 影片文件触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致应用程序崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.x 至 10.6.4 版本及 QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本，攻击无需身份认证但需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3791"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.6.9 或更高版本，Mac OS X 用户应安装 2010-006 安全更新升级至 10.6.5。如无法立即升级，建议禁用浏览器 QuickTime 插件解析 MPEG 文件，并避免打开来源不明的媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3791.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3791","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3791.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3791.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3j88-7hxg-wjh6/GHSA-3j88-7hxg-wjh6.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_macosx_su10-007.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_769.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_113900_114000.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime769.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-3791.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0243","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3790","title":"Apple QuickTime 图像样本转换越界内存破坏漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理特制影片文件时存在内存破坏漏洞。当解析影片文件中的图像样本变换时，程序未能正确校验精灵缩放操作的缓冲区边界，导致越界内存访问。远程攻击者可构造恶意影片文件，通过诱导用户打开触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.0 至 10.6.4 版本，用户需升级至 10.6.5 以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3790"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"立即将 QuickTime 升级到 7.6.9 或更高版本（Mac OS X v10.5.8/Windows 系统），或升级到 Mac OS X v10.6.5 或更高版本（Mac OS X v10.6 系统）。如无法立即升级，建议不要打开来源不明的媒体文件，并在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":